{"id":"wb-6-632","name":"宝严寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"宝严寺塔","text":"宝严寺塔是位于中华人民共和国河南省驻马店市西平县的一座仿楼阁式砖构佛塔，是第六批全国重点文物保护单位，俗称“东关塔”。\n宝严寺塔现存塔体始建于北宋时期，作为西平县重要的宋代古建筑遗存，宝严寺塔反映了宋代中原地区的砖塔建筑艺术，是研究佛教文化和当地历史的重要实物资料。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E4%B8%A5%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":95188934,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95188934","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3ba4380ed055f6d51e612f54.jpg","title":"20260906_Baoyan_Temple_Pagoda_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260906_Baoyan_Temple_Pagoda_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b5/20260906_Baoyan_Temple_Pagoda_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南西平 宝严寺塔","width":320,"height":480}}